    "details": "<p>The <strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"397\">Hackathon at Vishnu Institute of Technology, Bhimavaram (VITB)</strong> is a platform that is created to foster innovation, creativity, and problem-solving among students. It provides a unique opportunity for participants to work collaboratively in teams and develop solutions to real-world challenges. This event is not just a competition, but also a learning experience where students can enhance their technical skills, improve teamwork, and gain valuable exposure to innovation-driven problem-solving.</p>\n<p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"853\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1564\">\n<li data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1053\">The hackathon is open for the Under Graduate all over India,&nbsp;as this event is meant to encourage internal talent and collaboration.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1294\"><strong>All years B. Tech students</strong> from all engineering branches (AI&amp;DS, CSE, IT, ECE, EEE, Mechanical, Civil, AI &amp;ML, etc.) are eligible. This ensures fair competition among students with similar levels of exposure and knowledge.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1564\"><strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1337\">Inter-college teams are allowed.</strong></li>\n</ul>",
